title: Exfiltration via MEGAcmd Client
id: ed3a554c-82ae-4207-a461-2a54fb68c211
status: experimental
description: Detects use of the MEGAcmd command-line client (mega-put, mega-copy, megacmd) to upload data to MEGA cloud storage, a channel favored by ransomware crews for bulk exfiltration.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1567/002/
logsource:
  category: process_creation
detection:
  selection:
    Image|contains:
      - 'megacmd'
      - 'mega-put'
      - 'mega-copy'
    CommandLine|contains:
      - 'put'
      - 'sync'
      - 'copy'
  condition: selection
fields:
  - CommandLine
  - Image
  - User
falsepositives:
  - Sanctioned MEGA usage
level: high
tags:
  - attack.exfiltration
  - attack.t1567.002
